", "id": "mereka tertawa", "ur": "وہ ہنستے ہیں", "bn": "তারা হাসে", "fa": "می‌خندند"}}]}, {"ref": "53:60", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4844.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And laugh and not weep,", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Gülüyorsunuz da ağlamıyorsunuz?", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور ہنستے ہو اور روتے نہیں", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan kamu mentertawakan dan tidak menangis?", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَتَضْحَكُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/bd9e8e50b08ef7c86861.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i smijete se", "en": "and you (all) laugh", "tr": "ve gülüyorsunuz", "fr": "et vous riez", "id": "dan kalian tertawa", "ur": "اور تم ہنستے ہو", "bn": "এবং তোমরা হাসো", "fa": "و شما می‌خندید"}}, {"text": "وَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَبْكُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "11:71", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hiya", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1544.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And his wife, standing by laughed when We gave her good tidings (of the birth) of Isaac, and, after Isaac, of Jacob.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "İbrahim'in karısı ayakta duruyordu bunun üzerine yüzü güldü. Ona İshak'ı ve İshak'ın arkasından da Ya'kub'u müjdeledik.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور اس کی بی بی کھڑی تھی وہ ہنسنے لگی تو ہم نے اسے اسحاق کی خوشخبری دی اور اسحاق کے پیچھے یعقوب کی", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan isterinya berdiri (dibalik tirai) lalu dia tersenyum, maka Kami sampaikan kepadanya berita gembira tentang (kelahiran) Ishak dan dari Ishak (akan lahir puteranya) Ya'qub.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَٱمْرَأَتُهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "قَآئِمَةٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَضَحِكَتْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/e75d83a90f3c37b1a53c.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i nasmijala se", "en": "and she laughed", "tr": "ve güldü", "fr": "et elle rit", "id": "lalu dia tertawa", "ur": "تو وہ ہنس پڑی", "bn": "তখন সে হেসে ফেলল", "fa": "پس خندید"}}, {"text": "فَبَشَّرْنَٰهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِإِسْحَٰقَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَمِن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَرَآءِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِسْحَٰقَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَعْقُوبَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "يَضْحَكُونَ", "count": 3, "first": "43:47", "audio": "audio/9eeccca23ab974e526d9.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "they laugh", "bs": "smiju se", "tr": "gülerler", "fr": "ils rient", "id": "mereka tertawa", "ur": "وہ ہنستے ہیں", "bn": "তারা হাসে", "fa": "می‌خندند"}}, {"arabic": "فَلْيَضْحَكُوا۟", "count": 1, "first": "9:82", "audio": "audio/7040b49082e3d8d1a8b8.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "jussive"}], "gloss": {"en": "so let them laugh", "bs": "pa neka se smiju", "tr": "gülsünler", "fr": "qu'ils rient alors", "id": "biarlah mereka tertawa", "ur": "پس وہ ہنسیں", "bn": "অতএব তারা হাসুক", "fa": "پس بخندند"}}, {"arabic": "فَضَحِكَتْ", "count": 1, "first": "11:71", "audio": "audio/e75d83a90f3c37b1a53c.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hiya", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"bs": "i nasmijala se", "en": "and she laughed", "tr": "ve g